# Visual Basic: Visual Basic language reference (Keywords, Comments, String data type); requirements/languages/vb.md
name     vb vbnet visualbasic vba vbs vbscript

keyword  AddHandler AddressOf Alias And AndAlso As ByRef ByVal Call Case Catch Class Const Continue Declare
keyword  Default Delegate Dim DirectCast Do Each Else ElseIf End Enum Erase Error Event Exit Finally For
keyword  Friend Function Get GetType Global GoTo Handles If Implements Imports In Inherits Interface Is
keyword  IsNot Let Lib Like Loop Me Mod Module MustInherit MustOverride MyBase MyClass Namespace Narrowing
keyword  New Next Not Of On Operator Option Optional Or OrElse Overloads Overridable Overrides ParamArray
keyword  Partial Private Property Protected Public RaiseEvent ReadOnly ReDim RemoveHandler Resume Return
keyword  Select Set Shadows Shared Static Step Stop Structure Sub SyncLock Then Throw To Try TryCast
keyword  TypeOf Using When While Widening With WithEvents WriteOnly Xor
type     Boolean Byte Char Date Decimal Double Integer Long Object SByte Short Single String UInteger
type     ULong UShort Variant
builtin  True False Nothing CInt CStr CDbl CBool MsgBox Console
fold-case

line-comment   '
string   " "  : doubled
operators  +-*/\^&=<>:
calls
hook     rem
